*(Repost to the public discuss list of a note originally sent to the
keyholders list on 2026-08-13; lightly redacted for the public archive.)*

Hey there!

Heading out soon to bang around the bus after this rain shower clears, I've
tentatively set some working hours for this week. If these times work I'll
post them as working hours.

Curious where we might be with lease + entity development - I'd be game to
get networking routed to the bus if that seems sane.

I think routing bidi simplex via a local ISP or similar would be the
pragmatic / legally lowest profile path for near term networkies. If this
sounds good, I can arrange this to completion once we have the various legal
blessings sorted. 🐝 I can be reached here via email ^w^

Other options could include WISPing or point-to-point links at considerably
greater complexity / scope.

-Jess
